{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EZK","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以西結書","commonName":"以西結書","title":"以西結書","order":26,"numberOfChapters":48,"sha256":"22119bcebbf291618307759c2e882a027ddc83c5ffa69a805a937dc20ae4ec6b","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/1.json","lastChapterNumber":48,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/48.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1271},"chapter":{"number":27,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["為泰爾唱哀歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華對我說："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「人子啊，你要為泰爾唱哀歌，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["告訴位於海口、跟沿海各民族通商的泰爾，主耶和華這樣說，",{"text":"「『泰爾啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你曾誇耀自己完美無瑕。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的疆域在大海上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的建造者把你造得完美無瑕。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們用示尼珥的松木做你的船板，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用黎巴嫩的香柏木做桅桿，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用巴珊的橡木做你的槳，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把象牙鑲嵌在基提沿岸的黃楊木上做甲板，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用埃及來的繡花細麻布做你的帆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"作為你的旗號，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用以利沙島來的藍布和紫布做船篷。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"西頓和亞發的居民是你的船夫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的智者在船上為你掌舵。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"迦巴勒的老手和巧匠在船上為你修補船篷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所有海船和水手都來與你做生意。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["「『你軍隊中的戰士有波斯人、路德人、弗人，他們在你的牆上掛起盾牌和頭盔，展示你的光彩。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["亞發人和你的軍隊都守衛在你的城牆上，歌瑪底人把守你的城樓，他們在你四圍的牆上掛滿盾牌，使你完美無瑕。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["「『他施人因你有豐富的貨物，就拿銀、鐵、錫、鉛來跟你交易。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["雅完人、土巴人、米設人也跟你通商，用奴隸和銅器來換取你的貨物。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["陀迦瑪人用馬匹、戰馬和騾子來跟你交易。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["底但人也是你的客商，你的市場遠及沿海一帶，他們拿象牙、烏木來跟你交易。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["因為你的貨物豐富，亞蘭人也成了你的客戶，他們用綠寶石、紫布、刺繡、細麻布、珊瑚和紅寶石與你交換貨物。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["猶大和以色列也是你的客商，他們用米匿的麥、餅、蜜、油和香料與你交換貨物。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["大馬士革見你的貨物豐富，就用黑本的酒和沙哈的羊毛來跟你交易。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["從烏薩來的威但人和雅完人用熟鐵、肉桂、菖蒲與你交換貨物。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["底但人用馬鞍墊來跟你交易。"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["阿拉伯人和基達的所有首領都來做你的客商，他們用羊羔、綿羊和山羊來跟你交易。"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["示巴和拉瑪的商人用各類上等香料、寶石和黃金交換你的貨物。"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["哈蘭、干尼、伊甸、示巴、亞述和基抹的商人都來跟你交易，"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["他們把華麗衣服、藍布、刺繡和彩色地毯捆紮結實，拿來跟你交易。"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"text":"「『他施的船隻替你運貨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你在海上載滿沉甸甸的貨物。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"船夫把你搖到汪洋之中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但東風要把你擊碎在海中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的財富、貨物、商品、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"水手、舵手、修補匠、客商、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"戰士和人民在你傾覆的日子都要沉到深海裡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你舵手的哀號聲必震動海岸，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所有的船夫、水手、舵手都必棄船登岸，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為你放聲痛哭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把塵埃撒在頭上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在灰中打滾，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又為你剃光頭發，腰束麻布，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並為你傷心哭泣，痛苦哀號。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":32,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們在痛哭中為你唱起哀歌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哀悼你說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有哪一座城像泰爾一樣在深海中銷聲匿跡呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":33,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的貨物由海上運出，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"滿足了許多國家；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的資財和貨物使地上的君王富裕。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":34,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如今你在汪洋中被海浪擊碎，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的貨物和人民都一同沉沒了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":35,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沿海的居民因你而驚駭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"君王都嚇得面容失色。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":36,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各國商人都嗤笑你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你那可怕的末日來臨了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你將永遠不復存在。』」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/27.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/28.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/26.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":36}